<title>USA: Asante cuts Fast Ethernet prices.</title>
<headline>Asante cuts Fast Ethernet prices.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asante Technologies Inc said it cut prices on some of its Fast Ethernet products by up to 30 percent.</p>
<p>It said the price cuts resulted from increased product demand.</p>
</text>
